# On the Appropriateness of Certain Algorithms for Analyzing Needs Assessment Data: A Reaction to Cummings' (1985) Study.

**Authors:** Misanchuk, Earl R.

## Abstract
This personal reaction to Cummings'&quot;Comparison of Three Algorithms for Analyzing Questionnaire-Type Needs Assessment Data to Establish Need Priorities&quot; specifically questions Cummings' use of the Mean Difference Analysis for comparison with Weighted Needs Index, and his focus on characteristics of the statistic that are of secondary importance. (MBR)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ337784

